## Lessons

- A large merged ticket is not evidence that every report has the same cause.
- Receipt time and merge time describe different events; neither proves a fix.
- Follow [decision 0003](/kb/decisions/0003-cause-triage-provenance) and the
  [current triage procedure](/kb/triage/dedupe), preserving anomalies and report IDs.
